 39-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 98, lines 39-37","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 98, lines 39-37"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on April 27, 2021."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 11-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 11-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 69, lines 49-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 69, lines 49-13"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["HollyFrontier wants the Court to allow a new refinery to claim an exemption extension.","The Renewable Fuels Association wants the Court to deny that specific request."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 25-19","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 25-19"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 46, lines 11-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 46, lines 11-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 65, lines 25-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-472_bp7c.pdf","page_label":"file page 65, lines 25-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 80, lines 39-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/o